lay: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n    }\n    .mall-details {\n        padding-left: 18px;\n        font-size: 15px;\n        color: #333;\n    }\n    .mall-details p {\n        margin: 8px 0;\n    }\n    .floating-btn {\n        position: fixed;\n        right: 10px;\n        top: 60%;\n        width: 36px;\n        height: 36px;\n        background: white;\n        border-radius: 50%;\n        box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        justify-content: center;\n        align-items: center;\n        color: #666;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        line-height: 0.8;\n        border: 1px solid #eee;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <h1>吃住篇</h1>\n    \n    <div class=\"author-info\">\n        <div class=\"avatar\">风少</div>\n        <span class=\"author-name\">风少</span>\n        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n        <span>今天创建</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"intro-text\">\n        <p>🏨吃住大家尽量以地铁站为中心，地铁站附近吃住都很方便，如爱联，吉祥，龙城广场，南联等，如果近的地铁站没有酒店了，就选远一点的，反正地铁都很方便</p>\n        <p>⚠️下图有大运中心附近的所有地铁站</p>\n        <p>酒店还没定的赶紧定，再晚就没了，深圳维也纳较多，实在没有酒店了场观附近还有几个水疗会所，也可以将就过夜</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"triangle\">▼</span> 龙岗商场</div>\n\n    <div class=\"mall-item\">\n        <div class=\"mall-name\"><span class=\"triangle\">▼</span> 星河cocopark</div>\n        <div class=\"mall-details\">\n            <p>地铁：大运站12号口（14号线、16号线）</p>\n            <p>美食：<span class=\"highlight\">海底捞</span>、胖哥俩肉蟹煲、吴庄等</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mall-item\">\n        <div class=\"mall-name\"><span class=\"triangle\">▼</span> 万科里</div>\n        <div class=\"mall-details\">\n            <p>地铁：龙城广场D口（3号线）</p>\n            <p>美食：街边铁桶烤肉、肉祭、八合里、原石牛扒</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mall-item\">\n        <div class=\"mall-name\"><span class=\"triangle\">▼</span> 仁恒梦广场</div>\n        <div class=\"mall-details\">\n            <p>地铁：愉园C口（16号线）</p>\n            <p>美食：79号渔船、文和友、渝月、</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mall-item\">\n        <div class=\"mall-name\"><span class=\"triangle\">▼</span> 万科广场</div>\n        <div class=\"mall-details\">\n            <p>地铁：吉祥站C口（3号线）</p>\n            <p>美食：SHADOW觅、西贝、凑凑火锅、蔡澜港式点心</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mall-item\">\n        <div class=\"mall-name\"><span class=\"triangle\">▼</span> 摩尔城</div>\n        <div class=\"mall-details\">\n            <p>地铁：南联B2口（3号线）</p>\n            <p>美食：老碗会、萨莉亚、小龙坎火锅</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mall-item\">\n        <div class=\"mall-name\"><span class=\"triangle\">▼</span> 天玑城</div>\n        <div class=\"mall-details\">\n            <p>地铁：南联B2口（3号线）</p>\n            <p>美食：<span class=\"highlight\">海底捞</span>、九毛九、大弗兰</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mall-item\">\n        <div class=\"mall-name\"><span class=\"triangle\">▼</span> 龙岗天光城</div>\n        <div class=\"mall-details\">\n            <p>地铁：爱联站D口（3号线）</p>\n            <p>美食：悦得闲、先启半步颠小酒馆、农耕记</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"floating-btn placeholder\" title=\"[Scroll Button: right-middle]\">\n        <span>▴</span>\n        <span>▾</span>\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
